3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNoECXrUj6EnSvz3eX9vo4i_FrmnbanS4ranSx7ZOmFSQ&oe=6AC64CAA"}, {"file_name": "InGame5.png", "id": "299048689891243", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974663_299048693224576_6811708882832108729_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PblpRAguMsUQ7kNvwEDO81W&_nc_oc=Adpc_i8n-iqwWnunFUgdcKZPwQmVkVHRZHc2HPh8rDidW-2doBvVif59phfox2Uromo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOYI26cw0S_WhqNW94siorMB7jQWoHowugHjvdrQGxe6A&oe=6AC676EA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560 x 1440px (24-Bit PNG) (3).png", "id": "2055428042513183", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595129854_2055428045846516_7051677881226262318_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UPp2irzVFlsQ7kNvwHZqm18&_nc_oc=Ado4M45Kf3vkqy-Es0Ut6ZKFGcLxqtjB8nmOu5zezpxL1MKPfiHk_blsctvwdcOWWtg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM5nEkiewo2Y0NIdiSU8L7OAlh-CYiFYA8sO9fj9w8vlQ&oe=6AC6679D"}, "display_name": "Mixed Snow Worlds", "keywords": ["Colocated", "FreeRoam", "multiplayer", "scan", "room"], "long_description": "# Transform Your Home into an Immersive Icy Wonderland \u2744\ufe0f\u2728\n\n**Welcome to Mixed Snow Worlds**, an auto-adaptive **Mixed Reality** game that transforms your home into an icy realm! Your entire environment, with all its objects, becomes part of a fully immersive free-roam MR and VR experience.\n{1335464791840179}\n\n## **\ud83d\udd2e TRANSFORM YOUR SURROUNDINGS INTO A PLAYSPACE**\n\nOur new 2Sync room scanner maps your room, then the icy world builds itself around your real walls and furniture. Scan a room once and reuse it in House Defender and Elven Arrows.\n\n{1060626293482363}\n\nIt's all up to you: Armed with a **trusty snow cannon** and a **special flashlight** that unveils the **hidden virtual world**, you set out to protect your home. \ud83c\udfe1\u2728 Adorable yet mischievous monsters pop through walls, eager to freeze everything with their chilly touch. \ud83e\uddca\n\n{1258471482128671}\n## **Why \"Mixed Snow Worlds\" Stands Out**\nThe game **adapts** to your home's layout. Move freely through your space and team up with a friend in the same room to fight side by side against the icy invasion. \u2744\ufe0f\u2694\ufe0f\n\n###\n## **Key Features:**\n- **Auto-Adaptive Mixed Reality** transforms your living space into a virtual ice battleground with the power of the **2Sync SDK**.\n- Seamlessly transition between **Mixed Reality and full immersion**.\n- Defend against dimension-hopping enemies with your **snow cannon** and **flashlight**.\n- **Worldwide leaderboard** for your high score.\n\n## **More from 2Sync:** \n\n-  House Defender\n-  The Last Galaxy\n-  Elven Arrows\n\nFind more: **games.2Sync.io**", "short_description": "Your Home - Enchantingly Frozen. Welcome to Mixed Snow Worlds, an auto-adaptive Mixed Reality game that transforms your home into an icy realm! It's all up to you: Armed with a trusty snow cannon and a special flashlight that unveils the hidden virtual world, you set out to protect your home. Adorable yet mischievous monsters pop through walls, eager to freeze everything with their chilly touch. Play solo or team up with a friend in the same room."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://2sync.io/appinfo/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://2sync.io/appinfo/", "publisher_name": "2Sync", "support_website_url": "https://2sync.io/discord", "website_url": "https://2sync.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area